WEBVTT

00:00:47.678 --> 00:00:49.238
We should go.

00:00:54.798 --> 00:00:56.598
I'm so cold.

00:01:13.598 --> 00:01:15.558
(WIND HOWLING)

00:01:17.158 --> 00:01:18.718
(RUMBLING)

00:01:23.158 --> 00:01:24.358
Susan!

00:01:41.198 --> 00:01:42.838
Where's Aslan?

00:01:44.358 --> 00:01:46.238
What have they done?

00:01:56.358 --> 00:01:57.918
Aslan!

00:02:01.878 --> 00:02:03.678
(LAUGHING)

00:02:06.478 --> 00:02:08.518
But we saw the knife. The Witch.

00:02:08.678 --> 00:02:11.918
If the Witch knew
the true meaning of sacrifice,

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:15.558
she might have interpreted
the Deep Magic differently.

00:02:15.718 --> 00:02:18.518
That when a willing victim
who has committed no treachery

00:02:18.718 --> 00:02:20.958
is killed in a traitor's stead,

00:02:21.118 --> 00:02:23.158
the Stone Table will crack

00:02:24.278 --> 00:02:27.158
and even death itself
will turn backwards.

00:02:27.838 --> 00:02:30.438
We sent the news that you were dead.

00:02:30.598 --> 00:02:32.598
Peter and Edmund
will have gone to war.

00:02:32.758 --> 00:02:34.158
We have to help them.

00:02:34.358 --> 00:02:37.278
(CHUCKLES) We will, dear one,
but not alone.

00:02:38.438 --> 00:02:39.958
Climb on my back.

00:02:40.118 --> 00:02:43.158
We have far to go
and little time to get there.

00:02:43.318 --> 00:02:45.918
And you may want to cover your ears.

00:02:46.118 --> 00:02:48.318
(ROARING)

00:03:06.518 --> 00:03:07.998
Fire!

00:03:28.318 --> 00:03:29.438
Yes!

00:03:42.318 --> 00:03:45.038
Fall back! Draw them to the rocks!

00:03:45.198 --> 00:03:46.358
(HORN BLOWING)

00:03:46.518 --> 00:03:48.958
That's the signal. Come on!

00:03:57.038 --> 00:03:58.838
Where are we going?

00:04:08.678 --> 00:04:09.958
Hang on!

00:04:11.598 --> 00:04:13.118
MAN: Fall back!

00:04:14.918 --> 00:04:16.558
Go on, fall back!

00:04:28.278 --> 00:04:29.438
(WHINNYING)

00:04:29.638 --> 00:04:31.038
(GRUNTS)

00:04:38.278 --> 00:04:40.398
(GRUNTING)

00:04:53.038 --> 00:04:54.438
Stop!

00:05:17.878 --> 00:05:20.198
(GROANING)

00:05:25.798 --> 00:05:27.678
(SCREAMING)

